Z||000014||AusFiero||04-21-2001||04:27 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex2004:<BR><B>On the turn signal lights, are those driving or fog lights?  And are they required on import fiero's?  Just wondering cause i want those lights.  Let me know!  Thanks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Alex...   <A HREF="mailto:Abercrombiealex15@hotmail.com">Abercrombiealex15@hotmail.com</A>  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The turn signals have parking lights incorporated into them, which is a requirement by Australian law. The parkers are compulsory, location is optional. That is the most unobtrusive place to put them. No idea what they was originally out of. I could probably source you a set though if you wanted them from the Fiero Shop Australia.||||reg||1
